'''''Viburnum macrocephalum''''' ({{lang-zh|繡球莢蒾}} "hydrangea viburnum", or {{lang|zh|木繡球}} "tree hydrangea"), [[common name]] '''Chinese snowball''', is a [[species]] of [[flowering plant]] in the [[Family (taxonomy)|family]] Adoxaceae (formerly [[Caprifoliaceae]]), [[native plant|native]] to mainland China.<ref name=grin>Germplasm Resources Information Network: [https://npgsweb.ars-grin.gov/gringlobal/taxonomydetail.aspx?id=41387 ''Viburnum macrocephalum '']</ref> Its fertile form, ''Viburnum macrocephalum'' f. ''keteleeri'' ({{lang-zh|瓊花}}, ''qiong hua'', "white jade flower"), is of great cultural significance in China.

